{
  "ALL_TEXT": "77 EXT. BABA'S ASHRAM-BACKYARD - DAY\nVEDA is smoking a cigarette, when GOVARDHAN walks up to him,\nan angry spring in his step.\nVEDA\nEnti, prasadam pettada?\nGOVARDHAN\nEnti raa prasaadam pettedidhi,\nvaadu asalu em matladtunnaado\ntelusaa?\nGOVARDHAN looses his temper. He starts searching for rocks to\nhit VEDA with. VEDA throws the cigarette he was smoking,\nwhich rolls towards a fuel barrel nearby. He starts punching\nVEDA with his free hands, pulls out a kerchief, throws it on\nVEDA\u2019s shoulder. While VEDA is wondering what GOVARDHAN is\ndoing, he bites into VEDA. VEDA also starts hitting GOVARDHAN\nand both of them are yelling obscenities at each other. For a\nwhile they fight each other, like people who barely know how\nto fight.\nVEDA\nRei\u2026 kukkalaa korukuthaav enti!!?\nVadulu\u2026 magaadila kotlaadu\u2026\nGOVARDHAN\nNaa ishtam!\nGOVARDHAN bites VEDA, again.\nVEDA\nAaaaaaaaaah!\nSULOCHANA runs in, not knowing quite what to do. In\ndesperation, she looks around for a way to make them both\ncome to their senses. She turns on the tap to fill an empty\nbucket. The bucket fills slowly with a thin stream of water.\nShe helplessly looks at them wrestling on the floor, biting\neach other. She takes the filled bucket, waits for a second,\nhoping they will realize what she is about to do. When they\ndon't, with a sigh, she pours the whole bucket of water on\nthem. They come to their senses and stare at SULOCHANA for a\nfew seconds. GOVARDHAN lets go of VEDA's arm from his mouth\nand wrings his kerchief dry. The three look at each other,\nthe situation slowly sinking into their heads.\nSULOCHANA\nayymaindi?\nGOVARDHAN does not butt in this time.\nVEDA\nSULOCHANA neeku thelsa!? GOVARDHAN\ninka baba chaaala close...GOVARDHAN\ninka baba kalisi...\nSULOCHANA\nKalisi?\nVEDA\nEmo GOVARDHAN ne adugu...\nGOVARDHAN\nTholutheestha malli aa maatante.\nSULOCHANA\nBha!... Aaputhaara!...\nLooking at GOVARDHAN\nSULOCHANA\nAsalu em chesochhaaru iddaru\nlopala???\nGOVARDHAN\nEmchesi ravatam enti? vaadu\nprasadam antunnadu aashirwaadam\nantunnadu\nSULOCHANA\nNaaku eppudu ivvaledu.. baba neeku\nichara? teeskovachu kada\nGOVARDHAN\nNeeku ela cheppaali..\nSULOCHANA\nNuvvu anni tingari tingari gaa\nmatladtunnaavu, Okkasaari Baba ni\nkalisi vastha...Aayana chaala\nmanchi vaaru... nenani theleedemo..\nAedo mis-understanding.\nVEDA\nAmaayakathvama, balupa?... Inka\nmanchi vaarantaav enti?...\nNot heeding VEDA, she briskly walks towards BABA's chambers.\nVEDA and GOVARDHAN soon follow.\nCUT TO:",
